### ======================================================
### FILTER BY COMBINED FIELDS
### ======================================================

### 26. Get By App Name and Department - SAP + IT
GET http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/app/SAP/department/IT

### 27. Get By App Name and Department - SAP + HR
GET http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/app/SAP/department/HR

### 28. Get By App Name and Place Name - SAP + Main Office
GET http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/app/SAP/place/Main%20Office

### 29. Get By App Name and Place Name - Oracle + Branch Office
GET http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/app/Oracle/place/Branch%20Office

### 30. Get By Department and Place Name - IT + Main Office
GET http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/department/IT/place/Main%20Office

### 31. Get By Department and Place Name - Finance + Branch Office
GET http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/department/Finance/place/Branch%20Office

### 32. Get By Employee Name and App Name - Ahmed Ali + SAP
GET http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/emp-name/Ahmed%20Ali/app/SAP

### 33. Get By Employee Name and App Name - Mohamed Hassan + Oracle
GET http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/emp-name/Mohamed%20Hassan/app/Oracle

### ======================================================
### ERROR RESPONSES
### ======================================================

### 34. Get Non-Existent Complaint (Should return 404)
GET http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/999

### 35. Create Complaint with Missing Fields (Should return 400)
POST http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appName": "",
  "complaintName": ""
}

### 36. Delete Non-Existent Complaint (Should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/emp-complaints/999

### ======================================================
### RESPONSE EXAMPLES
### ======================================================
# Success (200/201): Full complaint object with all fields
# Not Found (404): {"message": "Employee complaint not found with id: 999"}
# Bad Request (400): {"appName": "App name is required", "complaintName": "Complaint name is required"}


### ######################################################
### RETRIEVE EMP DATA API
### ######################################################
### Base URL: http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp

### 37. Create RetrieveEmpData
POST http://localhost:9999/tasks-complaint-emp/api/retrieve-emp-data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empId": 1001,
  "empName": "أحمد محمد",
  "empType": "permanent",
  "empJob": "Engineer",
  "empDegree": "Senior",
  "empLocation": "Cairo",
  "empDept": "IT",
  "empAdmin": "Admin1",
  "empSector": "Sector1"
}

